      "summary": "The Arquillian team is proud to announce the 1.16.0 release of the Arquillian Cube Extension component! What is Arquillian Cube Extension? With Arquillian Cube you can control the lifecycle of Docker images as part of the test lifecyle, either automatically or manually....",
